# 02 - Aircraft Configuration

This section dives deeper into how an aircraft object is configured. We will learn how to:

1. Understand the geometry parameters (fuselage, wing, empennage)
2. Explore how derived quantities (wing area, aspect ratio, tail areas) are computed
3. Examine the mass component inputs (actuators, furnishings, avionics, etc.)
4. Create custom configurations by modifying JSON files

